sentences.text:
The Tribunal appreciating the pleading and evidence of both the parties, by the impugned judgment dated 18.03.2015 partly allowed the petition and awarded compensation of Rs.16,37,000/- under following heads with interest at the rate of 6% p.a. from the date of petition till realization of the entire amount and fastened the liability on respondent Nos.1 and 2;
 Sl. No. Heads Amount (Rs.)
 1. Loss of dependency 15,12,000  2. Towards consortium 50,000  3. Towards love & affection 25,000  4. Towards loss to the estate 25,000  5. Towards funeral expenses 25,000  Total 16,37,000 9.
